OL,4,CSurvey reveals 'major increase' in     
OL,5,Ccost of living                         
OL,6,GThere has been "a major increase" in   
OL,7,Gthe overall cost of living in the past 
OL,8,G12 months in Guernsey, Jersey and the  
OL,9,GIsle of Man, a survey has found.       
OL,11,FIsland Global Research, a market       
OL,12,Fresearch and consultancy company,      
OL,13,Ffound more than 69% of respondents in  
OL,14,FJersey, 68% in Guernsey and 70% in the 
OL,15,FIsle of Man said they had noticed a    
OL,16,Fcost increase.                         
